<title>USA: PACCAR splits stock, increases dividend.</title>
<headline>PACCAR splits stock, increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PACCAR Inc on Tuesday said its board declared a two-for-one split of its common stock and increased its regular quarterly dividend by 20 percent to $0.15 cents per newly split share.</p>
<p>The truck manufacturer will issue the new shares on or before May 21 to stockholders of record at the close of business on May 9.</p>
<p>The quarterly cash dividend is payable on June 9 to stockholders of record at the close of business on May 28.</p>
</text>
